👨🏻‍💻 Vacancy: Backend Developer Profile
🏢 Company: «Autoguide» LLC

🤖💻 Role: Backend Developer with AI-Assisted Development Experience

📋 Core Competencies:
 •    Languages:  Java 17+ (primary), Python (secondary);
 •    Frameworks: Spring Boot 3.x (WebFlux, Spring Data R2DBC/JPA, Spring Security, Spring Cloud);
 •    AI Development Tools: Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, or comparable AI coding assistants – demonstrable experience integrating AI into daily workflow;
 •    Authentication: Keycloak, OAuth2/OIDC, JWT handling;
 •    Databases:  PostgreSQL, MongoDB, query optimization, schema design;
 •    Caching/Messaging: Redis (caching, session management, pub/sub);
 •    Testing: JUnit 5, Mockito, Testcontainers for integration testing;
 •    Containerization: Docker, Docker Compose, multi-stage builds;
 •    CI/CD: GitLab CI/CD pipelines, automated testing integration;
 •   API Design: RESTful APIs, OpenAPI specification, Postman;
 •   Documentation: Confluence, API documentation, ADRs;
 •   Project Management: Jira, Agile/Scrum methodology.

✅ Nice to Have:
 •   Reactive programming patterns (Project Reactor);
 •   Monitoring: Prometheus, Grafana, ELK stack;
 •   Message queues: Kafka or RabbitMQ.

🗣 Languages: 
 •    English (fluent, required)
 •    Russian (advantageous)

AI Integration Focus:
Candidate should demonstrate practical experience using AI tools throughout the development lifecycle: code generation, unit/integration test creation, debugging assistance, code review, and documentation. Understanding of prompt engineering for complex technical tasks and ability to critically evaluate AI-generated solutions is essential.

